o/blog/cold-email-copywriting"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"body copywriting in cold emails","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" builds deeper engagement after the initial hook. The body copy is the place where you say ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"who you are","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"what you can do for the recipient","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", and ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"why they can trust you to do it","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":".Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"After you have ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"briefly ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"introduced yourself, include the following elements in your email body:Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Description of the recipientâ€™s pain pointsÂ ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"One clear benefit you can provide","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Specific numbers tied to the benefit (if possible)","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Evidence (or testimonials) of your past successes","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The most important thing about your body copy is that it should ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"focus on the recipient","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":". Â  This doesnâ€™t necessarily mean you have to write everything in the second person (you), but it should address their pain points in a compelling way and avoid sounding like a cheap sales pitch.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"There are lots of ways you can build up a picture of a particular segmentâ€™s pain points. Publicly available information in the form of reports, forums, and reviews of competitors (particularly the negative ones) is useful. Directly talking to customers and your sales team are also important. If youâ€™ve done the work in the initial research phase, you should have all the information you need to speak directly to your recipientâ€™s needs.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hereâ€™s an example of strong body copy:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Â My nameâ€™s Ava of Artisan. I automate outbound email outreach for sales teams that are struggling to scale. A recent client saw a 50% increase in monthly revenue and called us â€œA total game-changer.â€","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"It works because itâ€™s to-the-point, concise, focuses on a single pain point, describes a clear benefit, and provides proof that the sender can deliver.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 5: Create a Compelling and Clear Call-To-Action (CTA)","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"One particular type of CTA shines when it comes to closing a cold email: the interest CTA. It essentially reads, â€œWould you like to learn more?â€ It's worth testing to discover whether it outperforms more definite CTAs like â€œAre you free this Thursday at 3 PM?â€ and definite commitment requests like â€œAre you free next week?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Of course, A/B testing should be emphasized here. Different recipients have different needs. A busy founder may appreciate you sending over a Calendly link, whereas a more cautious small business owner might want additional information.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Here are some examples and why they work:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Would you like to learn more?","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Why does it work?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Itâ€™s an open question that invites the recipient to respond without having to make a substantial commitment.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Would you like to discuss this?","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Why does it work?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Offers a more definite option for busy recipients who may want to jump straight to a meeting.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If you send me a Calendly link, I can book a time to meet.Â ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Why does it work? ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Itâ€™s a straightforward, specific action that is more reliable than sending your own Calendly link (which requires additional steps from the recipient).Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Would you like to see a case study?","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Why does it work? ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Sparks curiosity while asking for a clear response.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 6: Include Your Professional Email SignatureÂ ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A well-crafted email signature adds professionalism, turns off spam defence filters, and reinforces your personal or company brand.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Include the following in your signatures for your sales emails and follow-up emails:Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Name and title","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Company name","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Contact information (including number)","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Social media account","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"