he engagement of decision makers.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Implementing a thorough writing process is the main part of the battle when it comes to cold email. But you also need to optimize it with regular reviews and data analysis.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Letâ€™s look at the main mistakes salespeople make when writing cold emails.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"1S2rMXZBtMJSxibUmHQt5Z","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-10-01T22:47:51.847Z","updatedAt":"2024-10-01T22:47:51.847Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":10,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Checklist Cold Email Mistakes","description":"The headline \"Checklist: Cold Email Mistakes\" with the following bullet points: Writing generic content, Using spam trigger words, Sending a cold email that is too short or too long, Opening with irrelevant personalization, Using poorly crafted templates, and Not testing different copy variations. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/1S2rMXZBtMJSxibUmHQt5Z/55396b98dbad61bf887d7235cbddeea1/Checklist__Cold_Email_Mistakes__.webp","details":{"size":80006,"image":{"width":1093,"height":727}},"fileName":"Checklist_ Cold Email Mistakes â€¨.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Writing Generic Content ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A typical employee receives an average of 121 emails a day, according to Microsoft's ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/worklab/work-tre